      "text": "Mate, that was nearly perfect.",
      "hash": "1788c7c6",
      "file": "1788c7c6.mp3",
      "bytes": 7750,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vc8",
      "text": "Okayyy! One more like that.",
      "hash": "1cf49eaf",
      "file": "1cf49eaf.mp3",
      "bytes": 9213,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vc9",
      "text": "Bro, you’re actually cooking.",
      "hash": "69250c5c",
      "file": "69250c5c.mp3",
      "bytes": 6601,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vc10",
      "text": "That was clean. Painfully close.",
      "hash": "f7bee748",
      "file": "f7bee748.mp3",
      "bytes": 9213,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vc11",
      "text": "Respect. That was close-close.",
      "hash": "c7a9d1a8",
      "file": "c7a9d1a8.mp3",
      "bytes": 7959,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vc12",
      "text": "Nah, that deserved better.",
      "hash": "94a8d001",
      "file": "94a8d001.mp3",
      "bytes": 7019,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "Okayyy! I see you.",
      "hash": "b4ef82b9",
      "file": "b4ef82b9.mp3",
      "bytes": 7019,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "Wait... you got better?",
      "hash": "1681a1cc",
      "file": "1681a1cc.mp3",
      "bytes": 6392,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "Nah, who helped you?",
      "hash": "5f62295e",
      "file": "5f62295e.mp3",
      "bytes": 6287,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "text": "Okay, that was kinda clean.",
      "hash": "23fcbd35",
      "file": "23fcbd35.mp3",
      "bytes": 6392,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "text": "Look at you go!",
      "hash": "edec1df9",
      "file": "edec1df9.mp3",
      "bytes": 4616,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p8",
      "text": "Who gave you skills?",
      "hash": "b412e600",
      "file": "b412e600.mp3",
      "bytes": 5869,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p9",
      "text": "Oh no. You’re learning.",
      "hash": "4a6daa50",
      "file": "4a6daa50.mp3",
      "bytes": 5869,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p10",
      "text": "Don’t get cocky now.",
      "hash": "c1519b02",
      "file": "c1519b02.mp3",
      "bytes": 5660,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p11",
      "text": "New best? Okay, respect.",
      "hash": "14c5efe2",
      "file": "14c5efe2.mp3",
      "bytes": 8795,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "p12",
      "text": "My guy is improving!",
      "hash": "c7c6a042",
      "file": "c7c6a042.mp3",
      "bytes": 6287,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "st1",
      "text": "Aaaand you ruined it.",
      "hash": "a54a6936",
      "file": "a54a6936.mp3",
      "bytes": 5347,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st2",
      "text": "Bro sold the streak.",
      "hash": "219665a7",
      "file": "219665a7.mp3",
      "bytes": 6392,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st3",
      "text": "NOOO! You had it!",
      "hash": "6cca5e39",
      "file": "6cca5e39.mp3",
      "bytes": 5660,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st4",
      "text": "Fam. Why would you do that?",
      "hash": "d524254a",
      "file": "d524254a.mp3",
      "bytes": 7123,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st5",
      "text": "There goes the streak.",
      "hash": "432a5eb2",
      "file": "432a5eb2.mp3",
      "bytes": 5347,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st6",
      "text": "You fumbled so hard.",
      "hash": "f73b5882",
      "file": "f73b5882.mp3",
      "bytes": 6810,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st7",
      "text": "Bro choked.",
      "hash": "9b6b510c",
      "file": "9b6b510c.mp3",
      "bytes": 4407,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st8",
      "text": "I knew it wouldn’t last.",
      "hash": "d21f9030",
      "file": "d21f9030.mp3",
      "bytes": 5869,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st9",
      "text": "That streak deserved better.",
      "hash": "9742b2d4",
      "file": "9742b2d4.mp3",
      "bytes": 7123,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st10",
      "text": "Welp. Back to zero.",
      "hash": "5674ac3d",
      "file": "5674ac3d.mp3",
      "bytes": 6810,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st11",
      "text": "Bro had momentum too.",
      "hash": "2f8c1231",
      "file": "2f8c1231.mp3",
      "bytes": 6810,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "st12",
      "text": "That one hurt me too.",
      "hash": "dd3a8d63",
      "file": "dd3a8d63.mp3",
      "bytes": 6078,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "pf1",
      "text": "BRO?! Okay, calm down.",
      "hash": "1b59197f",
      "file": "1b59197f.mp3",
      "bytes": 6601,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf2",
      "text": "Nah. Do that again.",
      "hash": "8fb1c4ee",
      "file": "8fb1c4ee.mp3",
      "bytes": 5660,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf3",
      "text": "WAIT. You actually did it?!",
      "hash": "36791a68",
      "file": "36791a68.mp3",
      "bytes": 6601,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf4",
      "text": "Okay, show-off.",
      "hash": "999af4f2",
      "file": "999af4f2.mp3",
      "bytes": 5869,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf5",
      "text": "I hate that that was perfect.",
      "hash": "56252eec",
      "file": "56252eec.mp3",
      "bytes": 7332,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf6",
      "text": "Who are you right now?",
      "hash": "990608f5",
      "file": "990608f5.mp3",
      "bytes": 5347,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf7",
      "text": "Fine! You win this one.",
      "hash": "10f638cf",
      "file": "10f638cf.mp3",
      "bytes": 6810,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf8",
      "text": "Bro turned into a robot.",
      "hash": "2babebf9",
      "file": "2babebf9.mp3",
      "bytes": 7959,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf9",
      "text": "Nah, I need a replay.",
      "hash": "4aa967fd",
      "file": "4aa967fd.mp3",
      "bytes": 6392,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf10",
      "text": "Okay. That was filthy.",
      "hash": "c9b4a2b3",
      "file": "c9b4a2b3.mp3",
      "bytes": 6392,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf11",
      "text": "That was PERFECT perfect.",
      "hash": "ed2f5435",
      "file": "ed2f5435.mp3",
      "bytes": 7332,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pf12",
      "text": "Alright bro, you cooked me.",
      "hash": "382e77e7",
      "file": "382e77e7.mp3",
      "bytes": 7019,
      "existing": true
    },
    {
      "id": "x1",
      "text": "Fam. Be serious.",
      "hash": "c1876b30",
      "file": "c1876b30.mp3",
      "bytes": 5869,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x2",
      "text": "Bro... no.",
      "hash": "bf0b3457",
      "file": "bf0b3457.mp3",
      "bytes": 4929,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x3",
      "text": "What was THAT?",
      "hash": "cc1c8d28",
      "file": "cc1c8d28.mp3",
      "bytes": 4407,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x4",
      "text": "Nah. Run it back.",
      "hash": "0394af47",
      "file": "0394af47.mp3",
      "bytes": 5869,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x5",
      "text": "My guy. Please.",
      "hash": "9bae72ce",
      "file": "9bae72ce.mp3",
      "bytes": 6078,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x6",
      "text": "You’re getting cooked.",
      "hash": "ca6f2d97",
      "file": "ca6f2d97.mp3",
      "bytes": 5660,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x7",
      "text": "That was rough.",
      "hash": "9d9c9c26",
      "file": "9d9c9c26.mp3",
      "bytes": 4407,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x9",
      "text": "You can do better than THAT.",
      "hash": "012d1ce3",
      "file": "012d1ce3.mp3",
      "bytes": 7019,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x10",
      "text": "Mate. Come on.",
      "hash": "b603e24f",
      "file": "b603e24f.mp3",
      "bytes": 5347,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x11",
      "text": "Ain’t no way, bro.",
      "hash": "5cdb971b",
      "file": "5cdb971b.mp3",
      "bytes": 5451,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "x12",
      "text": "Fam, I’m trying to help you.",
      "hash": "9b550f6e",
      "file": "9b550f6e.mp3",
      "bytes": 7019,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "text": "Oh. We’re just interrupting people now?",
      "hash": "e74096b9",
      "file": "e74096b9.mp3",
      "bytes": 8691,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "text": "Fam, can I finish ONE sentence?",
      "hash": "be387f45",
      "file": "be387f45.mp3",
      "bytes": 9736,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "text": "Bro keeps hitting retry like I’m not talking.",
      "hash": "b4c6dc76",
      "file": "b4c6dc76.mp3",
      "bytes": 11303,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "text": "Nah. You definitely heard me talking.",
      "hash": "322347ca",
      "file": "322347ca.mp3",
      "bytes": 8795,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "text": "DAMN. Can I finish?!",
      "hash": "76494a4f",
      "file": "76494a4f.mp3",
      "bytes": 5869,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "text": "My guy, I have WORDS left.",
      "hash": "e786451f",
      "file": "e786451f.mp3",
      "bytes": 10885,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "text": "You know what? Forget it. Go lose again.",
      "hash": "b2b17c27",
      "file": "b2b17c27.mp3",
      "bytes": 10363,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "text": "Oh, don’t mind me. Clearly you’re busy.",
      "hash": "ff119eba",
      "file": "ff119eba.mp3",
      "bytes": 10154,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "text": "I’m literally being bullied by a retry button.",
      "hash": "50de751e",
      "file": "50de751e.mp3",
      "bytes": 13079,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "text": "Fine. Speedrun my disrespect too.",
      "hash": "61ae73a1",
      "file": "61ae73a1.mp3",
      "bytes": 10154,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "text": "Nah nah, keep clicking. I wasn’t saying anything important.",
      "hash": "ee423e00",
      "file": "ee423e00.mp3",
      "bytes": 14647,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "text": "This man has beef with complete sentences.",
      "hash": "5f000bd2",
      "file": "5f000bd2.mp3",
      "bytes": 10676,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i13",
      "text": "Bro, I was MID-SENTENCE.",
      "hash": "604770ea",
      "file": "604770ea.mp3",
      "bytes": 8064,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i14",
      "text": "Mate! Let me TALK.",
      "hash": "5ae11078",
      "file": "5ae11078.mp3",
      "bytes": 5660,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i15",
      "text": "Fam, you cut me off AGAIN.",
      "hash": "7431a651",
      "file": "7431a651.mp3",
      "bytes": 7019,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "i16",
      "text": "You really said skip dialogue in real life.",
      "hash": "1667bd6e",
      "file": "1667bd6e.mp3",
      "bytes": 9945,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rs1",
      "text": "Oh wow. You let me finish. Growth.",
      "hash": "0f789a1b",
      "file": "0f789a1b.mp3",
      "bytes": 8795,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rs2",
      "text": "Look at that. A full sentence. Beautiful.",
      "hash": "436bc45a",
      "file": "436bc45a.mp3",
      "bytes": 11094,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rs3",
      "text": "Thank you. I finally got to finish one.",
      "hash": "acad30f6",
      "file": "acad30f6.mp3",
      "bytes": 9422,
      "existing": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rs4",
      "text": "See? Listening wasn’t that painful.",
      "hash": "c98516b0",
      "file": "c98516b0.mp3",
      "bytes": 9631,
      "existing": false
    }
  ]
}
